Package: penguinscope
Title: Explore Palmer Penguin Body Measurements
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Tushar", "Dhanorkar", email = "dhanorkartushar2au@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An interactive data product for exploring the Palmer Penguins
    dataset. It helps the user compare the body measurements of the three
    penguin species across islands and sex, through a Shiny app, bundled
    data and summary functions.
